// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/pointing.h>

#define Base        0
#define Media       1
#define Nav         2
#define Mouse       3
#define Sym         4
#define Num         5
#define Fun         6
#define Button      7
#define Game        8
#define Gameplus    9

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <170>;
};

&lt {
    tapping-term-ms = <240>;
    flavor = "balanced";
    quick-tap-ms = <150>;
};

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm: homerow_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            global-quick-tap;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        enterchord {
            bindings = <&kp ENTER>;
            key-positions = <17 18 16>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            layers = <0 1 2 3 4>;
        };

        escapechord {
            bindings = <&kp ESCAPE>;
            key-positions = <11 12 13>;
            layers = <0 2 1 3 4>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };

        leftmouseclick {
            bindings = <&mkp MB1>;
            key-positions = <17 18 16>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            layers = <6>;
        };

        rightmouseclick {
            bindings = <&mkp MB2>;
            key-positions = <6 8 7>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            layers = <6>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            label = "Base";
            bindings = <
           &kp Q       &kp W       &kp E          &kp R         &kp T        &kp Y               &kp U        &kp I        &kp O       &kp P
           &hm LGUI A  &hm LALT S  &hm LCTRL D    &hm LSHIFT F  &kp G        &kp H               &hm RSHFT J  &hm RCTRL K  &hm RALT L  &hm RGUI SEMICOLON
&lt 3 F13  &kp Z       &kp X       &kp C          &kp V         &kp B        &kp N               &kp M        &kp COMMA    &kp DOT     &kp SLASH           &lt 4 APOSTROPHE
                                   &mt LCTRL DEL  &lt 1 TAB     &kp SPACE    &lt 6 LEFT_BRACKET  &lt 2 BSPC   &lt 3 MINUS
            >;
        };

        Nav {
            label = "Nav";
            bindings = <
              &trans          &trans       &kp UP_ARROW  &trans     &kp LBRC    &kp RBRC  &kp NUMBER_7  &kp NUMBER_8  &kp NUMBER_9  &kp PLUS
              &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp LEFT     &kp DOWN      &kp RIGHT  &kp LBKT    &kp RBKT  &kp NUMBER_4  &kp NUMBER_5  &kp NUMBER_6  &kp MINUS
&kp LEFT_ALT  &trans          &kp PAGE_UP  &trans        &kp PG_DN  &kp LPAR    &kp RPAR  &kp NUMBER_1  &kp NUMBER_2  &kp NUMBER_3  &kp KP_MULTIPLY  &trans
                                           &trans        &trans     &trans      &trans    &trans        &kp NUMBER_0
            >;
        };

        Sym {
            label = "Sym";
            bindings = <
           &kp EXCL  &kp AT  &kp HASH  &kp DOLLAR  &kp PERCENT    &kp CARET  &kp AMPERSAND  &kp ASTERISK  &kp SQT  &kp DQT
           &trans    &trans  &trans    &trans      &trans         &trans     &trans         &trans        &trans   &trans
&kp GRAVE  &trans    &trans  &trans    &trans      &trans         &kp UNDER  &kp EQUAL      &trans        &trans   &kp SLASH  &kp BACKSLASH
                             &trans    &trans      &trans         &trans     &trans         &trans
            >;
        };

        Fun {
            label = "Fun";
            bindings = <
        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &kp C_NEXT  &kp C_VOL_UP
        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &to 5     &trans  &trans  &trans  &kp C_PP    &kp C_VOL_DN
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &kp C_PREV  &kp K_MUTE    &trans
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        Button {
            label = "Button";
            bindings = <
        &bt BT_CLR  &trans    &trans     &trans      &bt BT_SEL 0    &trans      &trans            &trans      &bootloader  &trans
        &kp LGUI    &kp LALT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LSHIFT  &bt BT_SEL 1    &trans      &kp RSHIFT        &kp RCTRL   &kp RALT     &kp RGUI
&trans  &trans      &trans    &trans     &trans      &bt BT_SEL 2    &trans      &trans            &trans      &trans       &trans    &trans
                              &trans     &trans      &trans          &kp C_PREV  &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE  &kp C_NEXT
            >;
        };

        Gaming {
            bindings = <
            &kp TAB         &kp Q  &kp W      &kp E         &kp R        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
            &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &kp A  &kp S      &kp D         &kp F        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&kp ESCAPE  &kp LCTRL       &kp Z  &kp X      &kp C         &kp V        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &to 0
                                   &kp LCTRL  &kp LEFT_ALT  &kp SPACE    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;

            label = "Gaming";
        };

        Mouse {
            bindings = <
        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &mkp MB1        &mmv MOVE_UP    &mkp MB2         &trans
        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_RIGHT  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans          &mkp MB3        &trans           &trans  &trans
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans          &trans
            >;
        };
    };
};
